# D153: the firmware's DoIDLE (camera key in ui_demo) closes the screen CSM while connected; the
# daemon (below idle) and the link stay; started again (side key) -> screen back; once more; Exit ->
# disconnect, screen + daemon closed. Checked by bg.sh. (Red = minimize is an MMI command that
# elfloader3-linux does not run: not tested here.)
wait 2
key enter
wait 3
shot b1_connected
key camera
wait 4
shot b2_idle
key side
wait 2
shot b3_back
key camera
wait 2
key side
wait 2
shot b4_top_again
key rsoft
wait 4
shot b5_exit
wait 2
